    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Melt Away&quot; is a traditional linear visual novel. Click on the screen to advance through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It features beautiful watercolor-style illustrations and a huge amount of imagery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everything is geared towards enjoying the story to the fullest.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no branching paths, and all resources are poured into &quot;narrating&quot; the story. Beautiful and extensive graphics, along with delicate music, maximize the charm of the story. Enjoy a supreme storytelling experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a stark white hospital room, she is playing the piano.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I thought of her vibrant rhythm as freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before I knew it, I started going to the hospital, gradually becoming attracted to her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Days of the ensuing summer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, I had forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something very important.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fact that happy everyday life does not last forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That it can be abruptly shattered by the sudden appearance of something invisible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Hey, I might die soon.&quot;</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Melt Away&quot; is a traditional linear visual novel. Click on the screen to advance through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It features beautiful watercolor-style illustrations and a huge amount of imagery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everything is geared towards enjoying the story to the fullest.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no branching paths, and all resources are poured into &quot;narrating&quot; the story. Beautiful and extensive graphics, along with delicate music, maximize the charm of the story. Enjoy a supreme storytelling experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a stark white hospital room, she is playing the piano.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I thought of her vibrant rhythm as freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before I knew it, I started going to the hospital, gradually becoming attracted to her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Days of the ensuing summer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, I had forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something very important.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fact that happy everyday life does not last forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That it can be abruptly shattered by the sudden appearance of something invisible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Hey, I might die soon.&quot;</p>",
